ly valid solution that uses new numbers, shows working for review, and names places/values. Reject copied model numbers.","question":"Solve one fresh problem that uses review with different numbers from the worked model. Show working and name the places or values that matter.","sample_answer":"Sample: new numbers solved with visible working for review; key places/values named. Do not award marks for retyping the model.","type":"short_answer"},{"explanation":"A useful correction changes the inaccurate idea or method and explains why.","marking_guide":"Accept a named misconception about review, corrected working, and a method reason. Reject vague “I was wrong” with no repair.","question":"Describe one likely mistake with review, show corrected working, and say why the correction works.","sample_answer":"Sample misconception: Skipping the reason on a review item hides the mistake type.. Correction uses Comparing / place value (hundreds vs tens after matching higher places).. Why: restores accurate review.","type":"short_answer"}],"resources":null,"response_prompt":"Include your independent working and reflection, with reasons where requested.","review_status":"unreviewed","seed_key":"s2-mat-y4-w02-l4","sort_activity":null,"source_note":"Proposed Stage 2 NESA mathematics alignment using verified outcome code wording where recorded in lesson-pipeline/sources; content-point mapping remains pending.","spelling":null,"spelling_focus":null,"stage":"S2","stage_hints":{"accept":["Today you will practise review.","Read the mission before you start calculating.","Keep the place or unit you are working with in view."],"guided":["Attempt the guided prompt without looking ahead.","Afterwards, compare your working with the feedback.","Adjust anything that does not match the method."],"learn":["Study how the first demonstration is built.","Point to the place or distance that carries the method.","Then write the reason without copying every sentence."],"quiz":["Read every option befor